@mattpocock I am concerned about the Batch Grill Me skill replacing `grilling`.

After heavy usage the last few days, I find it has immense value in terms of doing a more explicit job of tracking the decision tree and frontier. It might even be nice to persist that as a file.

However, the batch approach for me kills the spirit of grill-me. Being asked so many questions at once works for me personally, BUT I share the grill-me skill with many others and teach them that it’s super useful in reframing Claude Code usage BECAUSE it’s one question at a time. Original grill-me turns Claude Code into
